  "question": {
    "text": "The focus of the conic $x^{2}-6 x+4 y+1=0$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "(2,3)",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "(3,2)",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "(3,1)",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "(1,4)",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,\r\n$$\r\nx^{2}-6 x+4 y+1=0\r\n$$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad(x-3)^{2}-9+4 y+1=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad(x-3)^{2}+4 y-8=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad(x-3)^{2}=-4(y-2)$\r\nIt represents parabola whose vertex is (3,2)\r\n$\\therefore$ Focus $=(3,-1+2)=(3,1)$"
  }
}